  "endDateTime": {
    "$date": "2025-09-04T16:00:00.000Z"
  },
  "thumbnail": "https://stage-event-platform-bucket.s3.me-south-1.amazonaws.com/files/activity/689a1b18e83b77cd37b9e751/thumbnails/1bcc92db-4725-40fd-98cf-504d371cc4da.jpg",
  "category": "hospitality",
  "location": {
    "name": "Grand Hotel Milano",
    "address": "Via del Corso, 123, Monza, Italy",
    "mapLink": "https://maps.google.com/?q=Grand+Hotel+Monza"
  },
  "content": {
    "html": "<h1 style=\"font-size: 2em; font-weight: bold; color: #1f2937; margin: 1em 0; line-height: 1.5; font-family: inherit\">Welcome Reception</h1>\n<p style=\"margin: 1em 0; line-height: 1.5; color: #1f2937; font-family: inherit\">\n  Join us for an <strong style=\"font-weight: bold\">exclusive welcome reception</strong> to kick off our event. This elegant evening brings together distinguished guests, industry leaders, and valued\n  participants for an <em style=\"font-style: italic\">unforgettable networking experience</em> in a sophisticated setting.\n</p>\n<img\n  style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; margin: 20px auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1)\"\n  src=\"https://stage-event-platform-bucket.s3.me-south-1.amazonaws.com/files/activity/689a1b18e83b77cd37b9e751/thumbnails/1bcc92db-4725-40fd-98cf-504d371cc4da.jpg\"\n  alt=\"Welcome Reception Venue\"\n  title=\"Welcome Reception Venue\"\n/>\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 1.5em; font-weight: 600; color: #1f2937; margin: calc(1em * 0.8) 0; line-height: 1.5; font-family: inherit\">Reception Details & Schedule</h2>\n<p style=\"margin: 1em 0; line-height: 1.5; color: #1f2937; font-family: inherit\">\n  Our carefully orchestrated reception features distinguished guests and\n  <mark style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 235, 59, 0.3); padding: 2px 4px; border-radius: 3px\">premium networking opportunities</mark>. Every element is designed to create meaningful connections and\n  lasting impressions among our valued attendees.\n</p>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 1.17em; font-weight: 500; color: #1f2937; margin: calc(1em * 0.6) 0; line-height: 1.5; font-family: inherit\">Reception Highlights</h3>\n<ul style=\"margin: 1em 0; padding-left: 32px; color: #1f2937; font-family: inherit\">\n  <li style=\"margin: calc(1em * 0.5) 0; line-height: 1.5; color: #1f2937; font-family: inherit\">Welcome cocktails and premium refreshments</li>\n  <li style=\"margin: calc(1em * 0.5) 0; line-height: 1.5; color: #1f2937; font-family: inherit\">Live entertainment and ambient music</li>\n  <li style=\"margin: calc(1em * 0.5) 0; line-height: 1.5; color: #1f2937; font-family: inherit\">Curated <strong style=\"font-weight: bold\">networking zones</strong> for different industries</li>\n  <li style=\"margin: calc(1em * 0.5) 0; line-height: 1.5; color: #1f2937; font-family: inherit\">\n    Special <a style=\"color: #2563eb; text-decoration: underline; transition: opacity 0.2s ease\" href=\"https://www.google.com/search?q=welcome+reception+venues\">venue tour</a> available\n  </li>\n</ul>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; margin: 20px 0; font-family: inherit; border: 1px solid #d1d5db\">\n  <thead>\n    <tr style=\"border: 1px solid #d1d5db\">\n      <th style=\"border: 1px solid #d1d5db; padding: 12px 16px; background: #f9fafb; font-weight: 600; text-align: left; color: #1f2937; font-family: inherit\">Time</th>\n      <th style=\"border: 1px solid #d1d5db; padding: 12px 16px; background: #f9fafb; font-weight: 600; text-align: left; color: #1f2937; font-family: inherit\">Activity</th>\n      <th style=\"border: 1px solid #d1d5db; padding: 12px 16px; background: #f9fafb; font-weight: 600; text-align: left; color: #1f2937; font-family: inherit\">Host</th>\n      <th style=\"border: 1px solid #d1d5db; padding: 12px 16px; background: #f9fafb; font-weight: 600; text-align: left; color: #1f2937; font-family: inherit\">Location</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr style=\"border: 1px solid #d1d5db\">\n      <td style=\"border: 1px solid #d1d5db; padding: 12px 16px; color: #1f2937; font-family: inherit\">6:00 PM</td>\n      <td style=\"border: 1px solid #d1d5db; padding: 12px 16px; color: #1f2937; font-family: inherit\">Guest Check-in & Welcome Drinks</td>\n      <td style=\"border: 1px solid #d1d5db; padding: 12px 16px; color: #1f2937; font-family: inherit\">Event Staff</td>\n      <td style=\"border: 1px solid #d1d5db; padding: 12px 16px; color: #1f2937; font-family: inherit\">Main Lobby</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr style=\"border: 1px solid #d1d5db\">\n      <td style=\"border: 1px solid #d1d5db; padding: 12px 16px; color: #1f2937; font-family: inherit\">6:30 PM</td>\n      <td style=\"border: 1px solid #d1d5db; padding: 12px 16px; color: #1f2937; font-family: inherit\">Opening Remarks</td>\n      <td style=\"border: 1px solid #d1d5db; padding: 12px 16px; color: #1f2937; font-family: inherit\">Event Director</td>\n      <td style=\"border: 1px solid #d1d5db; padding: 12px 16px; color: #1f2937; font-family: inherit\">Reception Hall</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr style=\"border: 1px solid #d1d5db\">\n      <td style=\"border: 1px solid #d1d5db; padding: 12px 16px; color: #1f2937; font-family: inherit\">7:00 PM</td>\n      <td style=\"border: 1px solid #d1d5db; padding: 12px 16px; color: #1f2937; font-family: inherit\">Networking & Cocktails</td>\n      <td style=\"border: 1px solid #d1d5db; padding: 12px 16px; color: #1f2937; font-family: inherit\">All Guests</td>\n      <td style=\"border: 1px solid #d1d5db; padding: 12px 16px; color: #1f2937; font-family: inherit\">Garden Terrace</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr style=\"border: 1px solid #d1d5db\">\n      <td style=\"border: 1px solid #d1d5db; padding: 12px 16px; color: #1f2937; font-family: inherit\">8:30 PM</td>\n      <td style=\"border: 1px solid #d1d5db; padding: 12px 16px; color: #1f2937; font-family: inherit\">Dinner & Entertainment</td>\n      <td style=\"border: 1px solid #d1d5db; padding: 12px 16px; color: #1f2937; font-family: inherit\">Live Band</td>\n      <td style=\"border: 1px solid #d1d5db; padding: 12px 16px; color: #1f2937; font-family: inherit\">Main Dining Area</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr style=\"border: 1px solid #d1d5db\">\n      <td style=\"border: 1px solid #d1d5db; padding: 12px 16px; color: #1f2937; font-family: inherit\">10:00 PM</td>\n      <td style=\"border: 1px solid #d1d5db; padding: 12px 16px; color: #1f2937; font-family: inherit\">Closing Reception</td>\n      <td style=\"border: 1px solid #d1d5db; padding: 12px 16px; color: #1f2937; font-family: inherit\">Organizing Committee</td>\n      <td style=\"border: 1px solid #d1d5db; padding: 12px 16px; color: #1f2937; font-family: inherit\">VIP Lounge</td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 1.17em; font-weight: 500; color: #1f2937; margin: calc(1em * 0.6) 0; line-height: 1.5; font-family: inherit\">Special Message</h3>\n<blockquote style=\"margin: 1em 40px; padding: 16px; border-left: 4px solid #2563eb; background-color: #f9fafb; font-style: italic; color: #1f2937; font-family: inherit\">\n  \"This welcome reception sets the tone for an extraordinary event. We've thoughtfully designed every detail to create memorable first impressions and foster meaningful connections among our\n  distinguished guests.\" - Event Organizing Committee\n</blockquote>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 1.17em; font-weight: 500; color: #1f2937; margin: calc(1em * 0.6) 0; line-height: 1.5; font-family: inherit\">What to Expect</h3>\n<ol style=\"margin: 1em 0; padding-left: 32px; color: #1f2937; font-family: inherit\">\n  <li style=\"margin: calc(1em * 0.5) 0; line-height: 1.5; color: #1f2937; font-family: inherit\">\n    <strong style=\"font-weight: bold\">Premium Catering:</strong> Gourmet appetizers and signature cocktails\n  </li>\n  <li style=\"margin: calc(1em * 0.5) 0; line-height: 1.5; color: #1f2937; font-family: inherit\">\n    <strong style=\"font-weight: bold\">Live Entertainment:</strong> Professional musicians and ambient performances\n  </li>\n  <li style=\"margin: calc(1em * 0.5) 0; line-height: 1.5; color: #1f2937; font-family: inherit\">\n    <strong style=\"font-weight: bold\">Networking Opportunities:</strong> Connect with fellow attendees and industry professionals\n  </li>\n  <li style=\"margin: calc(1em * 0.5) 0; line-height: 1.5; color: #1f2937; font-family: inherit\">\n    <strong style=\"font-weight: bold\">Welcome Gifts:</strong> Exclusive branded items and information packets\n  </li>\n  <li style=\"margin: calc(1em * 0.5) 0; line-height: 1.5; color: #1f2937; font-family: inherit\">\n    <strong style=\"font-weight: bold\">Photo Opportunities:</strong> Professional photography and designated photo areas\n  </li>\n</ol>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 1.17em; font-weight: 500; color: #1f2937; margin: calc(1em * 0.6) 0; line-height: 1.5; font-family: inherit\">Event Resources & Information</h3>\n<p style=\"margin: 1em 0; line-height: 1.5; color: #1f2937; font-family: inherit\">\n  To enhance your reception experience, we recommend downloading our event app for the latest updates and networking features:\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin: 1em 0; line-height: 1.5; color: #1f2937; font-family: inherit\">\n  <code style=\"font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; background-color: #f9fafb; color: #2563eb; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 0.9em\">Event Connect Mobile App</code> available for\n  download, and access to our\n  <a style=\"color: #2563eb; text-decoration: underline; transition: opacity 0.2s ease\" href=\"https://www.google.com/search?q=event+networking+platform\">digital networking platform</a> for connecting\n  with other attendees.\n</p>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 1.17em; font-weight: 500; color: #1f2937; margin: calc(1em * 0.6) 0; line-height: 1.5; font-family: inherit\">Dress Code & Etiquette</h3>\n<p style=\"margin: 1em 0; line-height: 1.5; color: #1f2937; font-family: inherit\">\n  As this is a <em style=\"font-style: italic\">formal welcome reception</em>, we maintain a <strong style=\"font-weight: bold\">cocktail attire</strong> dress code. Smart business casual is also\n  <u style=\"text-decoration: underline\">acceptable</u> for networking portions. Please note that <s style=\"text-decoration: line-through\">overly casual wear</s> may not be appropriate for the main\n  reception areas.\n</p>\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 1.5em; font-weight: 600; color: #1f2937; margin: calc(1em * 0.8) 0; line-height: 1.5; font-family: inherit\">Venue Information & Access</h2>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; margin: 20px 0; font-family: inherit; border: 1px solid #d1d5db\">\n  <thead>\n    <tr style=\"border: 1px solid #d1d5db\">\n      <th style=\"border: 1px solid #d1d5db; padding: 12px 16px; background: #f9fafb; font-weight: 600; text-align: left; color: #1f2937; font-family: inherit\">Service</th>\n      <th style=\"border: 1px solid #d1d5db; padding: 12px 16px; background: #f9fafb; font-weight: 600; text-align: left; color: #1f2937; font-family: inherit\">Details</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr style=\"border: 1px solid #d1d5db\">\n      <td style=\"border: 1px solid #d1d5db; padding: 12px 16px; color: #1f2937; font-family: inherit\">Valet Parking</td>\n      <td style=\"border: 1px solid #d1d5db; padding: 12px 16px; color: #1f2937; font-family: inherit\">Complimentary valet service available at main entrance</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr style=\"border: 1px solid #d1d5db\">\n      <td style=\"border: 1px solid #d1d5db; padding: 12px 16px; color: #1f2937; font-family: inherit\">Shuttle Service</td>\n      <td style=\"border: 1px solid #d1d5db; padding: 12px 16px; color: #1f2937; font-family: inherit\">Every 15 minutes from designated pickup points</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr style=\"border: 1px solid #d1d5db\">\n      <td style=\"border: 1px solid #d1d5db; padding: 12px 16px; color: #1f2937; font-family: inherit\">Public Transport</td>\n      <td style=\"border: 1px solid #d1d5db; padding: 12px 16px; color: #1f2937; font-family: inherit\">Central Station within walking distance (8-minute walk)</td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 1.17em; font-weight: 500; color: #1f2937; margin: calc(1em * 0.6) 0; line-height: 1.5; font-family: inherit\">Contact Information</h3>\n<p style=\"margin: 1em 0; line-height: 1.5; color: #1f2937; font-family: inherit\">\n  For any inquiries or assistance during the reception, please reach out to our event staff. You can also find additional resources on\n  <a style=\"color: #2563eb; text-decoration: underline; transition: opacity 0.2s ease\" href=\"https://www.google.com/search?q=welcome+reception+planning\">Google</a> or visit our comprehensive\n  <a style=\"color: #2563eb; text-decoration: underline; transition: opacity 0.2s ease\" href=\"https://www.google.com/search?q=event+networking+tips\">networking guide portal</a>.\n</p>\n<blockquote style=\"margin: 1em 40px; padding: 16px; border-left: 4px solid #2563eb; background-color: #f9fafb; font-style: italic; color: #1f2937; font-family: inherit\">\n  <strong style=\"font-weight: bold\">Important:</strong> All attendees must present their invitation or QR code confirmation upon arrival. Digital check-in is available through our event app,\n  downloadable from the <a style=\"color: #2563eb; text-decoration: underline; transition: opacity 0.2s ease\" href=\"https://www.google.com/search?q=event+registration+app\">official event website</a>.\n</blockquote>\n<p style=\"margin: 1em 0; line-height: 1.5; color: #1f2937; font-family: inherit\">\n  We look forward to welcoming you to this <mark style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 235, 59, 0.3); padding: 2px 4px; border-radius: 3px\">memorable welcome reception</mark> and the beginning of an\n  exceptional event experience.\n</p>\n"
  },
