  "content": {
    "html": "<p style=\"margin: 1em 0; line-height: 1.5; color: #1f2937; font-family: inherit;\" style=\"margin: 1em 0; line-height: 1.5; color: #1f2937; font-family: inherit;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">The weekend begins with a powerful reveal, as Chivas Regal raises a glass to the unsung heroes of Scuderia Ferrari HP.</span></p><p style=\"margin: 1em 0; line-height: 1.5; color: #1f2937; font-family: inherit;\" style=\"margin: 1em 0; line-height: 1.5; color: #1f2937; font-family: inherit;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin: 1em 0; line-height: 1.5; color: #1f2937; font-family: inherit;\" style=\"margin: 1em 0; line-height: 1.5; color: #1f2937; font-family: inherit;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Thursday sets the tone for <em style=\"font-style: italic;\">I Rise We Rise</em> — a celebration of those who build together to make greatness possible.</span></p><p style=\"margin: 1em 0; line-height: 1.5; color: #1f2937; font-family: inherit;\" style=\"margin: 1em 0; line-height: 1.5; color: #1f2937; font-family: inherit;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin: 1em 0; line-height: 1.5; color: #1f2937; font-family: inherit;\" style=\"margin: 1em 0; line-height: 1.5; color: #1f2937; font-family: inherit;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Let’s raise a glass to tenacious teams.</span></p>"
