    "html": "<p style=\"margin: 1em 0; line-height: 1.5; color: #1f2937; font-family: inherit;\" style=\"margin: 1em 0; line-height: 1.5; color: #1f2937; font-family: inherit;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Step aboard Milan’s historic ATMosfera tram for an aperitivo with a Regal twist. An iconic journey through the city that kicks off the weekend by celebrating unsung heroes. Just as Chivas and Ferrari come together through precision and motion, this experience blends heritage, craft and momentum to set the tone for what’s ahead.</span></p>"
