  "content": {
    "html": "<p style=\"margin: 1em 0; line-height: 1.5; color: #1f2937; font-family: inherit;\" style=\"margin: 1em 0; line-height: 1.5; color: #1f2937; font-family: inherit;\">We all come together at shared tables to celebrate that excellence is never solo, its always collective: I Rise, We Rise. This evening will be a moment where we bring to life precision, creativity and tenacity, expressed through culture and cuisine.</p>"
