  "content": {
    "html": "<p style=\"margin: 1em 0; line-height: 1.5; color: #1f2937; font-family: inherit;\" style=\"margin: 1em 0; line-height: 1.5; color: #1f2937; font-family: inherit;\"><strong style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Art History Pairing</strong>&nbsp;<br>Discover the rich artistic heritage of Italy as a Milanese art historian guides you through Italian masterpieces that link with our crafted cocktails. You’ll take home a premium postcard pack featuring the artworks and some of our cocktail recipes, a keepsake to recreate the magic at home.&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin: 1em 0; line-height: 1.5; color: #1f2937; font-family: inherit;\" style=\"margin: 1em 0; line-height: 1.5; color: #1f2937; font-family: inherit;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin: 1em 0; line-height: 1.5; color: #1f2937; font-family: inherit;\" style=\"margin: 1em 0; line-height: 1.5; color: #1f2937; font-family: inherit;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin: 1em 0; line-height: 1.5; color: #1f2937; font-family: inherit;\" style=\"margin: 1em 0; line-height: 1.5; color: #1f2937; font-family: inherit;\"><strong style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Parmigiano Reggiano &amp; Mini Chivas Rosso </strong>&nbsp;<br>Watch pasta perfection come to life in a wheel of Parmigiano Reggiano, paired with miniature Chivas Rosso cocktails, where bold whisky meets Italian culinary theatre.&nbsp; &nbsp;</p>"
