    "html": "<p style=\"margin: 1em 0; line-height: 1.5; color: #1f2937; font-family: inherit;\" style=\"margin: 1em 0; line-height: 1.5; color: #1f2937; font-family: inherit;\"><strong style=\"font-weight: bold;\">The Icon Tasting</strong>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin: 1em 0; line-height: 1.5; color: #1f2937; font-family: inherit;\" style=\"margin: 1em 0; line-height: 1.5; color: #1f2937; font-family: inherit;\">A unique opportunity to experience both the most exclusive whisky in the Chivas Regal family, and the pinnacle of flavour – The Icon. </p><p style=\"margin: 1em 0; line-height: 1.5; color: #1f2937; font-family: inherit;\" style=\"margin: 1em 0; line-height: 1.5; color: #1f2937; font-family: inherit;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin: 1em 0; line-height: 1.5; color: #1f2937; font-family: inherit;\" style=\"margin: 1em 0; line-height: 1.5; color: #1f2937; font-family: inherit;\"><strong style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Behind the Helmet with Marc Gené</strong>&nbsp;<br>Get closer to the action as F1 legend and Scuderia Ferrari HP ambassador Marc Gené shares candid stories, bold insights, and moments from life both on and off the track. In this conversation, guests uncover the untold stories of the pit crews, engineers, and makers who embody true tenacity and relentless pursuit of excellence.</p>"
